        "accession_number": "0001709048-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our portfolio includes six differentiated product lines: power, ultra-low power Complementary Metal-Oxide Semiconductor (“CMOS”), silicon photonics, radio frequency (“RF”), and feature-rich CMOS, and in 2025, we’ve expanded our customizable Intellectual Property (“IP”) offerings and RISC-V expertise, with the acquisition of MIPS Holding, Inc.",
        "start_character": 3505,
        "end_character": 3849
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001709048-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001709048-26-000022-2e330c345eca27b7",
        "accession_number": "0001709048-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our products and technology subject to export controls in the regions where we operate.",
        "start_character": 13302,
        "end_character": 13389
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001709048-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001709048-26-000022-2e330c345eca27b7",
        "accession_number": "0001709048-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also leverage digital customer platforms, such as GF Connect, to streamline collaboration, design enablement, and support across the product lifecycle.",
        "start_character": 10646,
        "end_character": 10800
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001709048-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001709048-26-000022-2e330c345eca27b7",
        "accession_number": "0001709048-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete primarily in areas such as technology leadership and differentiation, manufacturing yields, time-to-volume production and cycle time, pricing and customer service, and design support.",
        "start_character": 11039,
        "end_character": 11233
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001709048-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001709048-26-000022-2e330c345eca27b7",
        "accession_number": "0001709048-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed and continue to develop resources that allow our customers to develop innovative products to fuel the global economy.",
        "start_character": 15993,
        "end_character": 16128
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001709048-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001709048-26-000022-2e330c345eca27b7",
        "accession_number": "0001709048-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We periodically conduct in-depth reviews of our patents and the industry’s manufacturing technologies, and we cull patents having limited or no value, yielding both savings in patent office maintenance fees and a strong, active patent portfolio.",
        "start_character": 16744,
        "end_character": 16989
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001709048-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001709048-26-000022-2e330c345eca27b7",
        "accession_number": "0001709048-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We primarily sell our manufacturing services through a direct sales organization supported by technical account managers and customer application engineers, who work closely with customers to understand and meet their design and production requirements.",
        "start_character": 10162,
        "end_character": 10415
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001709048-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001709048-26-000022-2e330c345eca27b7",
        "accession_number": "0001709048-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We serve a diverse customer base of global semiconductor designers and collaborate with a broad ecosystem of IP providers, Electronic Design Automation (“EDA”) vendors, design service firms, and Outsourced Semiconductor Assembly and Test (“OSAT”) partners.",
        "start_character": 5338,
        "end_character": 5594
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001709048-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001709048-26-000022-2e330c345eca27b7",
        "accession_number": "0001709048-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As power efficiency has become a critical success factor for the semiconductor industry, we strive to develop solutions that can lower the power consumption of digital technology.",
        "start_character": 20937,
        "end_character": 21116
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001709048-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001709048-26-000022-2e330c345eca27b7",
        "accession_number": "0001709048-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are subject to a wide range of environmental, health, and safety laws and regulations, which guide our practices in areas such as air emissions, wastewater management, handling of hazardous substances, and waste disposal.",
        "start_character": 13077,
        "end_character": 13301
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001709048-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001709048-26-000022-2e330c345eca27b7",
        "accession_number": "0001709048-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are the only scaled foundry with a global manufacturing footprint spanning the United States, Europe, and Asia operating for more than a decade.",
        "start_character": 2977,
        "end_character": 3124
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001709048-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001709048-26-000022-2e330c345eca27b7",
        "accession_number": "0001709048-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that these projects will enable us to expand and create new manufacturing capacity and capabilities to securely produce more essential chips for automotive, IoT (which includes aerospace and defense), smart mobile devices and data center and communications.",
        "start_character": 11764,
        "end_character": 12032
      }
